  "sourceTitle": "Spiced Lemon Aid",
  "sourceText": "Spiced Lemon Aid\nBy: Michelle La Clair\nPublished: Wednesday, February 24, 2010 - 8:54am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cups Water\n1 cup Sugar\n1 Lemon Rind\n4 whole Allspice berries\n4 whole Cloves\n1 teaspoon chopped crystallized Ginger\ndash of Nutmeg\n\n1 cup fresh Lemon juice\n1 cup Club soda\n\nPreparation\n\n1 In a pan simmer water, sugar, lemon rind, allspice berries, whole cloves, ginger, & nutmeg for 20 minutes. 2 Strain into a pitcher. 3 Stir in fresh lemon juice & club soda. 4 Chill Thoroughly.",
